    "body": "I haven't worked on this feature in Chromium, looping in @beverloo who originally shipped this:\r\nhttps://groups.google.com/a/chromium.org/g/blink-dev/c/0mBO8Q5FhTo/m/2OagzgagBgAJ\r\n\r\nI can't find use counters for this so I don't know anything about feasibility of removal.\r\n\r\nFor now, please assume Google would object to removal. I understand that won't change implementer interest, but we want everything we ship to be spec'd _somewhere_, so some action is needed here.",
